  "job_B17.9_20251003_114414": {
    "chunk_text": "& Ealdred arcebiscop hine to cynge & \u00f0a w\u00e6s Leofric abbot of Burh \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ilca feord.& s\u00e6clode \u00fe\u00e6r & com ham.& w\u00e6s d\u00e6d sone God are his saule. On his d\u00e6g w\u00e6s ealle blisse & ealle gode on Burh.& he w\u00e6s leaf eall folc.swa \u00fe\u00e6t se cyng geaf & he dyde swa mycel to gode into \u00fe\u00e6t mynstre of Burh on golde & on seolfre & on scrud & on \u00dea wear\u00f0 gildene burh to wrecce burh. \u00d0a cusen \u00fea munecas to abbot Brand prouost.for\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e god man & swi\u00f0e wis.& \u00dea \u00fee cyng Willelm geherde \u00fe\u00e6t secgen.\u00fea wear\u00f0 he swi\u00f0e wra\u00f0.& s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t se abbot him \u00dea eodon gode men heom betwenen & sahtloden heom for\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t se abbot w\u00e6s goddera manne. Geaf \u00fea \u00feone cyng xl marc goldes to sahtnysse.& \u00fea lifede he litle hwile \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6fter buton \u00fery Sy\u00f0\u00f0on comen ealle dr\u00e6uednysse & ealle ifele to \u00feone mynstre. God his gemyltse. Her for se cyng ofer s\u00e6.& h\u00e6fde mid him gislas & sceattas. & com \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00f0res geares on sancte Nicolaes m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.& \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges forbearn Cristes cyrce on & he geaf \u00e6lces mannes land \u00fea he ongean com. & \u00fe\u00e6s sumeres for Eadgar cild ut.& M\u00e6rle swegen.& fela manna mid heom.",
